title: QR Code Phishing (Quishing)
id: 1a445daa-258b-4b38-a0d7-1204017fff97
status: experimental
description: Detects emails containing a QR code image with little body text, a quishing technique that moves the malicious link into an image to evade URL scanning and push victims to scan with a personal device.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    has_qr_code_image: true
    body_url_count: 0
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate marketing emails with QR codes
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566
